impetus.options.extras.animations.all.name=Animations
impetus.options.extras.animations.all.tooltip=Animates textures such as water, lava, fire and portals. Turning this off freezes them on one frame and can noticeably raise frame rates on weaker graphics cards.

impetus.options.extras.particles.all.name=Particles
impetus.options.extras.particles.all.tooltip=Shows particles such as smoke, splashes and potion effects. Turning this off can greatly raise frame rates around busy farms and machines.
impetus.options.extras.particles.rain_splash.name=Rain Splashes
impetus.options.extras.particles.rain_splash.tooltip=Shows splashes where rain lands and smoke where it falls on lava.
impetus.options.extras.particles.block_break.name=Block Break
impetus.options.extras.particles.block_break.tooltip=Shows the burst of particles when a block is broken.
impetus.options.extras.particles.block_breaking.name=Block Breaking
impetus.options.extras.particles.block_breaking.tooltip=Shows the particles that fall while a block is being mined.

impetus.options.extras.details.sky.name=Sky
impetus.options.extras.details.sky.tooltip=Draws the sky. Turning it off also hides the sun, moon and stars.
impetus.options.extras.details.stars.name=Stars
impetus.options.extras.details.stars.tooltip=Draws stars at night.
impetus.options.extras.details.sun.name=Sun
impetus.options.extras.details.sun.tooltip=Draws the sun.
impetus.options.extras.details.moon.name=Moon
impetus.options.extras.details.moon.tooltip=Draws the moon.
impetus.options.extras.details.rain_snow.name=Rain & Snow
impetus.options.extras.details.rain_snow.tooltip=Draws falling rain and snow. The weather itself still happens.
impetus.options.extras.details.biome_colors.name=Biome Colors
impetus.options.extras.details.biome_colors.tooltip=Tints grass, leaves and water by biome. When off every biome uses plains colors, which makes chunks build faster.
impetus.options.extras.details.sky_colors.name=Sky Colors
impetus.options.extras.details.sky_colors.tooltip=Gives each biome its own sky color. When off every biome has the same blue sky.
impetus.options.extras.details.capes.name=Capes
impetus.options.extras.details.capes.tooltip=Draws player capes.
impetus.options.extras.details.held_item_tooltips.name=Held Item Tooltips
impetus.options.extras.details.held_item_tooltips.tooltip=Shows the item's name above the hotbar when you switch slots.

impetus.options.extras.render.fog.name=Fog
impetus.options.extras.render.fog.tooltip=Draws distance fog. Fog from blindness, water and lava is always shown.
