impetus.options.dynamiclights.mode.name=Dynamic Lights
impetus.options.dynamiclights.mode.tooltip=Lets held torches, dropped glowing items, burning mobs and other light sources light up the world around them. Faster settings update the light more often as sources move.
impetus.options.dynamiclights.mode.off=Off
impetus.options.dynamiclights.mode.slow=Slow
impetus.options.dynamiclights.mode.fast=Fast
impetus.options.dynamiclights.mode.realtime=Realtime

impetus.options.dynamiclights.self.name=Handheld Lighting
impetus.options.dynamiclights.self.tooltip=Lights up the area around you from what you hold or wear. Turn this off if your shader pack already does handheld lighting.
impetus.options.dynamiclights.entities.name=Entity Lighting
impetus.options.dynamiclights.entities.tooltip=Lets other entities give off light, such as dropped glowstone or burning mobs.
impetus.options.dynamiclights.block_entities.name=Block Entity Lighting
impetus.options.dynamiclights.block_entities.tooltip=Lets machines from mods that support dynamic lights give off light.
impetus.options.dynamiclights.water_sensitive.name=Extinguish Underwater
impetus.options.dynamiclights.water_sensitive.tooltip=Puts out torches and other fire-based lights while they are underwater.

impetus.options.dynamiclights.tnt.name=TNT Lighting
impetus.options.dynamiclights.tnt.tooltip=Chooses how lit TNT glows. Fancy brightens as the fuse runs out. Simple keeps one brightness and costs less.
impetus.options.dynamiclights.creeper.name=Creeper Lighting
impetus.options.dynamiclights.creeper.tooltip=Chooses how a creeper glows before it explodes. Fancy follows its flashing. Simple keeps one brightness and costs less.
impetus.options.dynamiclights.explosive.off=Off
impetus.options.dynamiclights.explosive.simple=Simple
impetus.options.dynamiclights.explosive.fancy=Fancy
