impetus.options.extras.group.camera=Zoom & Camera
impetus.options.defer_chunk_updates.tooltip=Controls whether the game waits for changed chunks before drawing a frame. None waits, so block changes show at once. One Frame allows a frame of delay for smoother frame rates. Always never waits, which is fastest but can make block changes appear late.
impetus.options.coarctatio.enabled.name=Memory Optimizations
impetus.options.coarctatio.enabled.tooltip=Reduces the memory used by models, textures, block states and world data, which shortens loading and lowers RAM use in large modpacks.\n\nSingle features are in config/impetus-coarctatio.cfg.\n\nTakes effect after a restart.
impetus.options.equilibrium.enabled.name=Game Logic Optimizations
impetus.options.equilibrium.enabled.tooltip=Speeds up mob AI, redstone, hoppers, chunk loading and other game logic without changing how the game plays.\n\nSingle patches are in config/equilibrium.properties.\n\nTakes effect after a restart.
